// Your display pins, loaded after the generated monitors.kdl so what you set
// here wins. Never shipped over, never rewritten by the display tooling.
//
// One block per output, keyed by the name `niri msg outputs` prints:
//
//   output "eDP-1" {
//       mode "2560x1600@165.001"
//       scale 1.6
//       position x=0 y=0
//   }
//
// A panel that lies about its EDID usually needs the mode spelled out here.
